  itemId: l14_union_letter
  displayName: A UNION LETTER
  kind: 1
  drugType: 0
  colour: {r: 0.96, g: 0.95, b: 0.88, a: 1}
  description: a union letter.
  logText: 'Commissioner: My members did not sign up to carry grenade launchers.
    You bought them after the tower fire, when the ladders stopped at the ninth floor
    and nobody could get up the stairs. Fine. It worked that night. Since then the
    papers call us the army, the police ask to borrow them, and a probationer put
    a canister through a window with a family behind it. No other department in the
    country does this. Take them back. The union.'
  readFlag: 
